## Migration Guide

Copy business code as Domains/<Feature>, with its IDomainModule and stable namespaces. No handwritten host registration is needed. Follow [Portability.md](../DeveloperReference/Portability.md) for version compatibility, dependencies, configuration and database upgrades. Preserve the complete existing migration history and snapshot for deployed databases; never generate a fresh baseline over existing tables. A service layer is optional; simple CRUD may use repositories directly.

