## guides/ and skills/

Standards and patterns are in `.claude/guides/` and `.claude/skills/`. Read before implementing:

| Guide | When to read |
|---|---|
{{- if model.manifest.tenant_ready }}
| `guides/TENANCY_RULES.md` | **Mandatory** before adding or changing any entity, query, cache key or background job |
{{- end }}
| `DeveloperReference/Observability.md` | Before adding logging, tracing, or metrics, and when triaging a production issue |
| `guides/OBSERVABILITY_PATTERN.md` | Before adding spans or metrics to a Genesis provider (Genesis providers only) |
| `guides/RESILIENCE_PATTERN.md` | Before making any AWS SDK calls |
| `guides/GENESIS_PROVIDERS.md` | Before using any Genesis module |
| `guides/PERVAXIS_STANDARDS.md` | General platform coding standards |
| `skills/csharp-coding-standards/` | C# patterns — read before writing any new class |
| `skills/microsoft-extensions-dependency-injection/` | DI registration patterns |


Ownership: Platform contains print-owned runtime code; Domains contains business modules. Data/Migrations is application-owned upgrade history and snapshot state, excluded from Platform replacement. See [the ownership and upgrade policy](../DeveloperReference/Ownership.md).
